    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah. it's like even when i'm sitting in a room full of people, i'm not really there. everyone's looking at the \"injured athlete,\" not the person i was. i feel like i'm just performing this role of a person who's surviving, but there's nothing actually happening inside. it's just... empty. like the story is already over and i'm just reading the epilogue.",
