      "content": "i guess. but rest doesn't really change the fact that the version of me that mattered is dead. i look at my old videos and i don't even recognize that person. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, waiting for something to happen that i know isn't coming. like, what's even the point of dragging out the credits when the movie ended years ago?",
